  "content": "<h1>東方小女僕</h1><p>這是一個Minecraft 1.16.5-1.20.1的Forge模組，靈感來自<a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a>模組和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">東方Project</a>。<br>\n在Minecraft中加入了可愛的女僕，她們可以幫助戰鬥、耕種以及執行其他任務。<br>\n該模組支援基岩版實體格式的自訂模型，您可以輕鬆切換女僕模型，或建立屬於自己的女僕模型。</p><h2>圖片</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ddb34836457d9b4daf1f72bd0f7cdad0da0953d.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eea50440aeeb0bea18858ee6afbf362a8f0f53e7.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8523790ba7c7abf66ba5cc315f6699277bf97761.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7493a33b9330b78b1ba228a1808d6d11a878635f.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\"></p><h3>影片</h3><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f1RlsOLinuis\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1RlsOLinuis</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fxKowWaJCIYA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xKowWaJCIYA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f8Eo2GM-a7iA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8Eo2GM-a7iA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><h2>注意事項</h2><ul>\n<li>如有任何意見或建議，歡迎前往<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">討論區</a>向我們反饋。</li>\n<li>如發現任何錯誤，歡迎前往<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報</a>提交問題。</li>\n<li>您可前往<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">發行版</a>下載快照版本模組，但請注意：<strong>快照版本模組非常不穩定</strong>。</li>\n</ul><h2>作者</h2><ul>\n<li>程式開發：<code>TartaricAcid</code>、<code>Snownee</code></li>\n<li>美術設計：<code>Succinum</code>、<code>Pajinyi</code>、<code>ZeniCrow</code>、<code>Tian_mi</code>、<code>Paulzzh</code>、<code>YurisCat</code></li>\n</ul><h2>致謝</h2><ul>\n<li>MMM和Verclene：製作了<a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a>模組</li>\n<li>ZUN：創作了<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">東方Project</a></li>\n<li>音效資源來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww14.big.or.jp%252f%257eamiami%252fhappy%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">あみたろの声素材工房</a></li>\n<li>LittleMaid PEKO音效：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://booth.pm/ja/items/1903163&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>五子棋AI：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/anlingyi/xechat-idea&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>其他以各種方式給予幫助的玩家們，以及您</li>\n</ul><h2>支援多種AI框架用於女僕AI聊天：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplayer2.game%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player2</a></li>\n<li>OpenAI</li>\n</ul><h2>授權條款</h2><ul>\n<li>程式碼：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mit.edu%252f%257eamini%252fLICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></li>\n<li>素材資源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul>",
